WEBVTT

00:06.640 --> 00:08.190
Let's have a duel,

00:08.270 --> 00:09.520
Executioner.

00:09.940 --> 00:10.900
What?

00:10.980 --> 00:12.270
A duel?

00:12.360 --> 00:15.570
If I win, you'll join Silver Sword.

00:16.440 --> 00:17.780
Then if I win,

00:17.860 --> 00:19.570
what will you do for me?

00:19.820 --> 00:22.200
The Guild will stay out
of the Executioner's business.

00:22.280 --> 00:23.160
No matter what happens,

00:23.240 --> 00:27.120
I can guarantee that
you won't lose your receptionist job.

00:29.250 --> 00:30.790
Skill Activate.

00:34.590 --> 00:36.210
From within a white magic sigil...

00:36.300 --> 00:37.760
A warhammer appears?

00:37.840 --> 00:40.970
So Ms. Alina really is the Executioner?

00:41.640 --> 00:43.300
That's the spirit.

00:43.600 --> 00:45.060
Sir Guild Master,

00:45.390 --> 00:47.770
thank you for your understanding

00:47.850 --> 00:51.560
and for being so merciful
to settle this with a bout of strength.

00:52.270 --> 00:53.310
Well then,

00:53.480 --> 00:55.440
for my peaceful life,

00:55.770 --> 00:58.940
die!

01:01.950 --> 01:03.370
Skill Activate!

01:03.450 --> 01:05.490
Sigurth Chronos!

01:22.550 --> 01:27.810
(I May Be a Guild Receptionist,
but I'll Solo Any Boss to Clock Out on Time)

02:42.210 --> 02:44.470
(Time Observer, Sigurth Chronos)

02:45.800 --> 02:47.050
From the looks of it,
she's not an executioner,

02:47.140 --> 02:48.430
but more like a wrathful deity.

02:48.510 --> 02:50.100
No, she's a dark god.

02:50.430 --> 02:53.060
But I think she's more powerful
than a dark god.

02:56.350 --> 02:57.350
What?

03:04.650 --> 03:06.280
I can't believe it.

03:06.360 --> 03:08.070
What was that just now?

03:08.450 --> 03:10.370
It's as if time stopped for a moment.

03:11.240 --> 03:13.950
This is my observation room.

03:14.040 --> 03:16.420
It's a space divided by the flow of time.

03:16.500 --> 03:18.710
By right, I should be
the only one able to move.

03:19.290 --> 03:20.750
However...

03:21.920 --> 03:23.760
So, is that how it is?

03:26.340 --> 03:27.260
Miss,

03:27.340 --> 03:28.840
I've lost this duel.

03:33.640 --> 03:36.440
Could you please explain what's going on?

03:37.350 --> 03:38.230
(Adventurers Guild Headquarters)

03:38.310 --> 03:40.400
(Adventurer's Guild Headquarters)
Well, I'm sorry.

03:40.860 --> 03:42.980
I've asked you to fight me

03:43.070 --> 03:44.690
because I wanted to confirm

03:44.780 --> 03:46.530
the true nature of your skill.

03:47.070 --> 03:48.070
The true nature?

03:48.320 --> 03:50.410
Skills can be divided into Regin skills,

03:50.490 --> 03:52.580
higher-ranking Sigurth skills,

03:52.950 --> 03:55.830
and Dia skills,
which are more powerful than both.

03:56.290 --> 03:57.210
(Dia Skill, Sigurth Skill, Regin Skill)
And then,

03:57.290 --> 03:59.580
(Dia Skill, Sigurth Skill, Regin Skill)
a skill can only be defeated

03:59.670 --> 04:01.230
(Dia Skill, Sigurth Skill, Regin Skill)
by a higher-ranking skill.

04:01.540 --> 04:04.090
That means your skill

04:04.460 --> 04:06.420
is indeed a Dia skill.

04:08.260 --> 04:09.680
I'm talking about a Dia skill.

04:09.760 --> 04:11.550
That's a legendary skill.

04:11.640 --> 04:12.640
Anyway,

04:13.140 --> 04:14.600
as you promised,

04:14.680 --> 04:16.980
please don't bother me anymore.

04:18.230 --> 04:19.770
White Tower.

04:19.850 --> 04:21.940
You've heard of it, right?

04:23.770 --> 04:25.730
So what about it?

04:26.150 --> 04:29.240
I got a report from Jade,
so I had someone look into it.

04:29.570 --> 04:32.450
And then, I really found it.

04:32.530 --> 04:35.240
A new dungeon called White Tower.

04:36.870 --> 04:39.540
The request form
that appeared in the relic

04:39.790 --> 04:42.750
was precisely a secret quest
hidden by the ancients.

04:43.130 --> 04:45.130
Who cares about that?

04:45.210 --> 04:48.670
Do you know what it means
when a new dungeon appears?

04:48.760 --> 04:51.090
The number of quests skyrockets!

04:51.180 --> 04:53.050
Who do you think handles
those quest requests?

04:53.140 --> 04:54.680
It's the receptionist!

04:54.760 --> 04:58.480
I'll be working overtime
until the dungeon is cleared!

04:59.180 --> 05:02.350
Overtime hell is about to start again.

05:02.440 --> 05:03.770
Overtime?

05:04.150 --> 05:05.440
Hey.

05:05.520 --> 05:09.190
Is she using her identity
as the Executioner to take down bosses

05:09.280 --> 05:11.280
because she doesn't want to work overtime?

05:11.360 --> 05:12.450
Exactly.

05:12.530 --> 05:13.530
What?

05:14.450 --> 05:16.040
Well, miss.

05:16.120 --> 05:19.370
This quest is quite troublesome
in many ways.

05:19.790 --> 05:20.870
I can pay you handsomely.

05:20.960 --> 05:22.000
Could you help...

05:22.080 --> 05:22.920
No!

05:23.210 --> 05:25.540
You want me to help
because it's troublesome?

05:25.630 --> 05:27.710
Didn't you just say
you'll stay out of my business?

05:27.800 --> 05:29.340
Are you breaking your promise?

05:29.420 --> 05:31.590
Is that what a Guild Master should do?

05:31.680 --> 05:33.180
That's true, but...

05:33.260 --> 05:35.680
I'm going to be very busy from now on.

05:35.760 --> 05:37.510
I'm sorry, but please find someone else.

05:37.930 --> 05:40.390
Then how about doubling
the number of receptionists

05:40.480 --> 05:41.940
at the Iffole Counter?

05:42.810 --> 05:44.150
What...

05:44.230 --> 05:45.230
did you just say?

05:45.480 --> 05:48.360
If you help the Silver Sword
clear this dungeon,

05:48.440 --> 05:51.820
I'll double the number of receptionists.

05:51.900 --> 05:53.070
What do you say?

05:58.160 --> 05:59.700
Double the number

05:59.790 --> 06:00.870
of receptionists.

06:01.250 --> 06:02.370
In other words,

06:02.460 --> 06:04.000
no matter how busy we get from now on,

06:04.080 --> 06:06.040
we can tackle it with sheer numbers

06:06.130 --> 06:10.090
and create an ideal work environment
without the need for overtime!

06:10.460 --> 06:12.220
Finally! Finally!

06:12.300 --> 06:16.260
My dream of going home
on time every day is coming true!

06:17.890 --> 06:20.770
I guess I have no choice.

06:21.180 --> 06:22.770
It's just this once.

06:24.140 --> 06:25.730
But in return,

06:25.810 --> 06:27.820
you have to keep your promise for sure

06:28.070 --> 06:30.190
that you won't let me work overtime!

06:30.570 --> 06:33.280
(Silver Sword Inn)

06:45.080 --> 06:46.500
This is...

06:49.340 --> 06:50.800
That's right.

06:50.880 --> 06:52.800
This is Silver Sword Inn.

06:53.050 --> 06:55.550
But isn't this too extravagant?

06:55.800 --> 06:57.800
All the furniture is high-end.

06:58.390 --> 07:00.850
And the bed is so soft and comfy.

07:00.930 --> 07:03.560
Maybe I'll indulge
in a luxurious sleep-in too.

07:03.640 --> 07:06.310
I can't get enough of this.

07:07.480 --> 07:10.070
Ms. Alina, I'm here to pick you up.

07:11.400 --> 07:12.480
Good grief.

07:12.570 --> 07:14.650
This guy always shows up
at the worst time.

07:15.950 --> 07:17.110
(Elm Canyon)

07:17.200 --> 07:20.370
Well then, let me introduce myself again.

07:20.450 --> 07:22.660
I'm a white mage and the healer,

07:22.750 --> 07:24.250
Lululi Ashford.

07:24.330 --> 07:26.710
I'll do my best to heal all your wounds.

07:27.330 --> 07:29.630
I'm a black mage and the rear attacker,

07:29.920 --> 07:31.460
Lowe Losblender.

07:31.710 --> 07:33.550
Since I'm a ranged attacker,

07:34.050 --> 07:35.760
I'll leave the close combat to you.

07:36.470 --> 07:39.180
I'm the receptionist, Alina Clover.

07:39.890 --> 07:41.640
But I'm sure you already know me.

07:43.180 --> 07:44.600
Ms. Alina.

07:45.140 --> 07:47.600
You're totally a working adult.

07:48.060 --> 07:49.860
Well then, let's go.

07:55.650 --> 07:58.610
Alina, you seem down.

07:58.700 --> 08:01.990
I heard she took paid leave
to come here today.

08:02.080 --> 08:03.200
Paid leave?

08:03.660 --> 08:06.160
But it's just one less day.

08:06.250 --> 08:07.250
What?

08:07.750 --> 08:08.710
The so-called paid leave

08:08.790 --> 08:10.580
is a reward for working adults.

08:10.670 --> 08:14.130
It's as precious as human rights!

08:14.210 --> 08:15.760
I'm sorry.

08:15.840 --> 08:17.300
- All right.
- Paid leave is very precious.

08:17.380 --> 08:18.220
- Look, guys.
- Repeat after me.

08:18.300 --> 08:20.470
I can see the White Tower in the distance.

08:22.390 --> 08:23.890
Clearing a dungeon and such?

08:23.970 --> 08:26.930
Watch us swish,
and finish it in an instant!

08:27.810 --> 08:28.640
(White Tower)

08:28.730 --> 08:29.810
(White Tower)
This is...

08:29.900 --> 08:31.360
(White Tower)
What about the other adventurers?

08:32.560 --> 08:34.900
The Guild is currently imposing
information control.

08:35.730 --> 08:38.320
Only first-class license cardholders
can take on the quest.

08:40.360 --> 08:42.660
By the way, before we enter the dungeon,

08:44.870 --> 08:48.370
this is a relic developed
by the Guild just for Silver Sword.

08:48.460 --> 08:50.080
It's a guiding crystal shard.

08:50.290 --> 08:52.710
All Silver Sword members have one.

08:53.040 --> 08:55.090
When the owner is on the verge of death,

08:55.170 --> 08:57.090
this crystal shard
will alert other allies.

08:58.880 --> 09:00.840
Well, I guess I'll keep it for now.

09:01.300 --> 09:02.890
You can make big bucks if you sell it.

09:02.970 --> 09:05.180
After all, it's a not-for-sale rare item.

09:06.270 --> 09:10.020
It also proves our camaraderie
as Silver Sword members!

09:10.560 --> 09:12.560
I'm just kidding.

09:14.430 --> 09:15.230
(First Floor)

09:15.230 --> 09:16.110
(First Floor)
Ms. Alina.

09:16.190 --> 09:17.900
(First Floor)
This is your first party battle, right?

09:17.990 --> 09:18.820
Yes.

09:18.900 --> 09:21.780
The frontline attacker
doesn't make the first move.

09:21.860 --> 09:25.120
The tank has to draw aggro
with magic first.

09:25.450 --> 09:27.580
I see. Got it.

09:30.750 --> 09:31.580
Watch out!

09:31.670 --> 09:32.830
Monster incoming!

09:37.550 --> 09:38.550
That's...

09:41.130 --> 09:42.840
A werewolf!

09:43.140 --> 09:44.550
It's huge!

09:44.640 --> 09:46.220
It's almost as big as a floor boss.

09:47.850 --> 09:48.850
Let's go!

09:52.140 --> 09:53.270
(Bewitching Light)
Hastor!

09:55.020 --> 09:56.980
All right! I've pulled aggro.

09:57.360 --> 09:58.440
Skill Activate!

09:58.780 --> 10:00.440
(Guardian of the Iron Wall)
Sigurth Wall!

10:06.160 --> 10:08.040
Now's our opening!

10:19.920 --> 10:21.300
I see.

10:21.840 --> 10:23.300
So this is a party battle.

10:24.300 --> 10:25.890
Did I do something wrong?

10:25.970 --> 10:27.390
No, not at all.

10:27.680 --> 10:28.930
There's no problem at all.

10:29.560 --> 10:31.730
Looks like I'm off duty today.

10:32.060 --> 10:34.480
Wow, that's amazing!

10:35.270 --> 10:37.480
I'm so touched!

10:37.560 --> 10:38.570
There, there.

10:38.650 --> 10:40.690
You'll be a great healer someday

10:40.990 --> 10:42.360
when you grow up.

10:43.990 --> 10:46.280
I'm older than you.

10:46.370 --> 10:49.160
Please don't treat me like a child.

10:49.870 --> 10:51.580
Is that so? Good girl.

10:51.660 --> 10:52.710
What does that mean?

10:52.790 --> 10:54.460
Well then, let's move on.

10:56.790 --> 10:59.500
There's no floor boss on the first floor.

10:59.750 --> 11:02.210
This is a first for me.

11:02.720 --> 11:04.430
A secret quest, right?

11:04.510 --> 11:06.590
What were the ancients thinking?

11:07.140 --> 11:09.470
The ancients who built this dungeon

11:09.560 --> 11:11.390
just vanished one day, right?

11:11.930 --> 11:14.100
Because they angered Dia.

11:14.690 --> 11:17.480
I think the ancients were
too obsessed with great power.

11:17.560 --> 11:19.520
That angered the gods.

11:19.610 --> 11:21.530
That's why they were wiped out.

11:21.860 --> 11:22.690
However,

11:22.780 --> 11:25.280
the real reason
for the ancients' disappearance

11:25.360 --> 11:26.860
is still unknown.

11:29.780 --> 11:32.580
(Second Floor)

11:35.410 --> 11:36.250
Just now,

11:36.330 --> 11:37.790
I thought I heard something.

11:41.750 --> 11:42.920
Is it from that room?

11:52.510 --> 11:54.140
(Healing Light)
Heal!

12:06.900 --> 12:08.780
They're dead.

12:26.300 --> 12:27.420
Ms. Alina.

12:28.260 --> 12:29.640
It's better if you don't look.

12:32.640 --> 12:35.140
To pierce a shield
and kill the tank in one blow,

12:35.220 --> 12:37.140
it must’ve had insane attack power.

12:37.520 --> 12:40.060
It doesn't look like the work
of a normal monster.

12:41.440 --> 12:43.730
No, this is...

12:44.190 --> 12:45.400
Rufus?

12:45.940 --> 12:47.150
Are you all right?

12:49.490 --> 12:50.780
What happened?

12:51.280 --> 12:53.580
A monster suddenly appeared
from over there.

12:54.160 --> 12:57.040
It was a humanoid monster.

12:57.330 --> 13:00.250
That guy even used a skill.

13:00.330 --> 13:02.170
A monster that uses skills?

13:04.460 --> 13:06.210
Was it attracted by the smell of blood?

13:06.300 --> 13:07.720
Skill Activate.

13:16.640 --> 13:18.680
That warhammer!

13:18.770 --> 13:21.270
Are you the Executioner?

13:23.190 --> 13:24.440
That's right.

13:26.400 --> 13:27.940
I see.

13:28.240 --> 13:31.070
You're with that monster, aren't you?

13:31.660 --> 13:33.950
He's just like you.

13:34.030 --> 13:35.620
He cast a white magic sigil

13:35.700 --> 13:37.580
and pulled out weapons from it.

13:38.120 --> 13:40.250
You monster!

13:42.920 --> 13:46.090
I see, so Rufus' party...

13:46.380 --> 13:50.050
They were second only to Silver Sword,
but they failed to defeat that monster.

13:50.550 --> 13:53.720
But after all, it's against a monster
that can use Dia skills.

13:54.140 --> 13:55.350
It can't be helped.

13:55.760 --> 13:58.890
Yes, I guess we'll have
to put the White Tower on hold.

13:58.970 --> 14:01.060
Are you putting
the dungeon clearing on hold?

14:01.390 --> 14:03.350
Don't say that cowardly stuff!

14:03.650 --> 14:07.070
You should know
how terrifying that dungeon is!

14:07.150 --> 14:08.400
Shut up!

14:08.480 --> 14:12.070
I've been pissed that you guys
are hogging the Silver Sword's spots.

14:12.150 --> 14:14.780
I'm the most suitable one
to join Silver Sword!

14:15.070 --> 14:16.780
Calm down, Rufus.

14:16.870 --> 14:17.910
Shut up!

14:17.990 --> 14:20.450
Do you want me to tell the townspeople

14:20.540 --> 14:22.670
that the Executioner
is actually a monster?

14:23.080 --> 14:26.040
You knew about this,
but kept it a secret, didn’t you?

14:26.130 --> 14:27.130
That's enough!

14:27.210 --> 14:28.340
Listen up!

14:28.420 --> 14:30.800
Kick the Executioner out of Silver Sword.

14:31.130 --> 14:33.590
Take me with you to the White Tower!

14:34.260 --> 14:36.430
What do you want?

14:36.680 --> 14:39.060
I want the relic, of course!

14:40.140 --> 14:42.560
The secret quest's hidden dungeon.

14:43.730 --> 14:47.900
There's a special relic resting
in the deepest part of that dungeon.

14:48.480 --> 14:50.030
Do you know what it is?

14:50.570 --> 14:53.240
It's a relic that grants you a Dia skill.

14:53.780 --> 14:55.740
I can't risk the lives of my companions

14:55.820 --> 14:57.530
on such uncertain intel.

14:57.620 --> 15:00.660
You have no right to refuse me!

15:04.420 --> 15:06.210
What? Is that so?

15:06.460 --> 15:07.290
That's right.

15:07.380 --> 15:09.630
We'll be taking Rufus
to the White Tower after this.

15:09.710 --> 15:12.010
So, Ms. Alina, you can return
to your receptionist position.

15:12.380 --> 15:13.380
I see.

15:13.840 --> 15:16.260
You're not going to say this doesn't count

15:16.340 --> 15:19.100
and ask me to clear
another dungeon, are you?

15:19.180 --> 15:20.180
No, we won't.

15:20.470 --> 15:21.310
Then,

15:21.390 --> 15:24.640
what about your promise to add more
receptionists and eliminate my overtime?

15:24.730 --> 15:27.230
We'll do our best to achieve that too.

15:28.270 --> 15:31.280
Somehow, his reaction is unnatural.

15:32.110 --> 15:34.190
Whatever, it's none of my business.

15:34.860 --> 15:35.990
In that case,

15:36.070 --> 15:38.620
today is the last day
I'll be staying in this room.

15:38.910 --> 15:40.660
I'm sad to see this bed go,

15:40.740 --> 15:41.910
but I'm going to pack my things.

15:41.990 --> 15:43.620
Can you please get out swiftly?

15:44.290 --> 15:45.500
Seriously.

15:45.580 --> 15:47.170
That's so your style, Ms. Alina.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.470
By the way,
you're in casual clothes today.

15:54.550 --> 15:55.590
What?

15:55.670 --> 15:58.970
I'm not a wage slave to the extent
of wearing my uniform on off days.

16:00.930 --> 16:03.600
I'm so lucky to see you
in casual clothes, Ms. Alina.

16:04.890 --> 16:06.100
What are you talking about?

16:06.190 --> 16:07.850
If you're leaving, hurry up and go.

16:08.100 --> 16:09.940
You're right. See you.

16:15.780 --> 16:18.450
Are you sure you'll be okay?

16:20.070 --> 16:21.740
That humanoid monster

16:21.830 --> 16:23.540
can use Dia skills, right?

16:23.990 --> 16:26.330
Can you defeat it with Sigurth skills?

16:26.830 --> 16:28.370
Even if we can't defeat it,

16:28.460 --> 16:30.330
we have to do what the top brass tells us.

16:31.170 --> 16:33.630
We're Silver Sword after all.

16:36.090 --> 16:37.170
Don't worry.

16:37.260 --> 16:39.890
Even if we run into him,
we'll escape right away.

16:42.260 --> 16:43.350
Ms. Alina.

16:43.720 --> 16:45.020
We

16:45.100 --> 16:47.020
will definitely come back safely.

16:48.480 --> 16:49.730
What are you saying?

16:49.810 --> 16:51.020
Isn't that a given?

16:53.270 --> 16:54.280
Right,

16:54.360 --> 16:55.190
the Guild Master said

16:55.280 --> 16:57.950
feel free to stay in this room
until your house is fixed.

16:58.280 --> 17:00.320
Well then, goodbye.

17:07.540 --> 17:09.460
Here you go, Mr. Shroud.

17:09.540 --> 17:12.210
Alina, you're energetic today too.

17:12.290 --> 17:13.880
You went to the dungeon, right?

17:13.960 --> 17:15.340
Tell me what happened.

17:15.420 --> 17:16.460
Again?

17:16.550 --> 17:17.800
You're so strange.

17:18.050 --> 17:18.880
That's because

17:18.970 --> 17:21.890
I want to be an invincible adventurer
when I grow up.

17:21.970 --> 17:23.850
Instead of risking your life,

17:23.930 --> 17:26.890
I'd recommend a safe and stable job
as a receptionist.

17:26.970 --> 17:28.730
Receptionist?

17:28.810 --> 17:29.850
Yes.

17:29.940 --> 17:31.980
You'll definitely be a beauty
when you grow up.

17:32.440 --> 17:33.860
You'd make a great receptionist.

17:33.940 --> 17:36.610
No, I want to take on quests with you.

17:37.070 --> 17:38.030
I'll work hard to get stronger.

17:38.110 --> 17:40.820
Let me protect you from now on, sir!

17:42.490 --> 17:44.240
And I'm not old enough to be called "sir."

17:44.330 --> 17:45.830
Madam Alina.

17:45.910 --> 17:46.740
What?

17:46.830 --> 17:48.370
Never mind that. Just pinky promise me.

17:48.450 --> 17:50.460
You can't go back on your promise, okay?

17:50.540 --> 17:52.290
All right.

17:52.370 --> 17:54.710
I'm a man of my word.

18:03.090 --> 18:04.550
Liar.

18:06.640 --> 18:07.810
Stop fooling around.

18:08.180 --> 18:09.640
Wake up.

18:10.390 --> 18:11.600
Hey.

18:12.350 --> 18:13.810
Didn't we make a promise?

18:14.560 --> 18:15.810
Hey!

18:16.190 --> 18:18.360
Mr. Shroud!

18:42.880 --> 18:45.760
I haven't had that dream for a long time.

18:47.760 --> 18:50.180
Do I have to work overtime again?

18:56.110 --> 18:57.270
Please, everyone,

18:57.360 --> 18:59.530
you must come back safely.

19:03.780 --> 19:06.870
You've been using
Sigurth Beast the whole time.

19:06.950 --> 19:09.290
Why don't you take a break?

19:09.540 --> 19:11.250
(White Tower, Third Floor)
I'm fine.

19:11.330 --> 19:13.960
(White Tower, Third Floor)
It's a necessary precaution to avoid encountering

19:14.040 --> 19:15.370
the humanoid monster.

19:15.670 --> 19:16.960
Even so...

19:17.840 --> 19:20.250
You can detect enemies
with that skill, right?

19:20.340 --> 19:22.380
You'd better keep it activated.

19:22.460 --> 19:24.380
Who do you think we came
all the way here for?

19:24.470 --> 19:25.880
Stop it, Lululi.

19:25.970 --> 19:26.970
But...

19:27.340 --> 19:29.760
I'll be fine. Let's go.

19:34.430 --> 19:35.730
(Fourth Floor)

19:35.730 --> 19:37.610
(Fourth Floor)
This is the last room.

19:43.030 --> 19:44.030
It reeks of blood.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.160
Lowe!

19:52.910 --> 19:54.250
Bright!

20:01.960 --> 20:02.960
This is...

20:03.050 --> 20:07.260
Could it be a monster that was killed?

20:09.930 --> 20:10.970
Are you

20:11.060 --> 20:13.470
the monster that killed those adventurers?

20:13.890 --> 20:17.020
I'm neither a monster nor a human.

20:17.480 --> 20:20.270
I'm the Dark God Silha.

20:21.570 --> 20:22.730
Dark god?

20:23.190 --> 20:24.400
Chant.

20:25.650 --> 20:27.780
(The Giant God's Raging Spear)
Dia Storm.

20:27.780 --> 20:28.630
(The Giant God's Raging Spear)

20:31.200 --> 20:33.410
(Guardian of the Iron Wall)
Skill Activate! Sigurth Wall!

20:35.450 --> 20:37.620
Great reaction.

20:37.710 --> 20:39.790
Seems like I can have some fun now.

20:41.040 --> 20:42.250
The shield has been...

20:42.340 --> 20:44.550
Leader, let's retreat for now.

20:44.630 --> 20:46.130
Skill Activate.

20:46.340 --> 20:48.180
Sigurth Prisoner.

20:48.550 --> 20:49.840
What?

20:50.510 --> 20:52.510
(Death Prisoners in the Iron Cell)
Is this your skill?

20:52.600 --> 20:54.520
Don't be ridiculous! Undo it now!

20:54.600 --> 20:56.180
Originally, that dark god

20:56.270 --> 20:58.850
was sealed here.

20:58.940 --> 21:02.900
But I heard if you feed him human souls,
the seal will be broken.

21:03.270 --> 21:04.900
Human souls?

21:06.440 --> 21:08.400
The wounds on their backs...

21:08.780 --> 21:11.280
Don't tell me
you killed your own companions?

21:11.370 --> 21:12.200
That's right.

21:12.280 --> 21:14.660
I killed them all to revive the dark god.

21:14.740 --> 21:17.370
And now, you're going
to be killed by the dark god here.

21:17.450 --> 21:19.790
Then I'll be able to obtain a Dia skill.

21:19.870 --> 21:22.500
In other words, I'm the sole winner!

21:23.340 --> 21:24.630
You bastard!

21:34.760 --> 21:36.890
Why?

21:37.850 --> 21:42.860
I'll devour all
who come into my line of sight.

22:05.710 --> 22:08.130
How disgusting.

22:08.210 --> 22:12.090
You really are a lowly,
despicable, and filthy soul.

22:12.510 --> 22:13.510
Now then,

22:14.430 --> 22:17.470
I wonder what your souls taste like.

23:53.240 --> 23:54.110
Next episode.

23:54.190 --> 23:57.320
Relics, secret quests, or dark gods
will get in the way of my work,

23:57.410 --> 23:58.870
so I'll beat them all up.

23:58.870 --> 24:00.870
(Next episode: Relics, Secret Quests,
or Dark Gods Will Get in the Way of My Work,
So I'll Beat Them All Up)
